  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu būndugumīla ū Gidioni balīhaya, “Nibūlī watwītīlile mihayo īlī gīko? Nguno kī walī ūtatwitanile aho wabūūka kūja kwilwisha būlūgū na a Bamidiani? Būyoga ho nang'hwe gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Ū nene naabeegije mhayo kī ū ntaale kūtinda īyo ng'wayītile a bing'we? Angū, a kapūmbīīlīle ka mizabibu a ka banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu katī na mpango ntaale kūtinda na a kahūlūlīle ka mizabibu a ka Baabiezeeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu wabatūūlile mu makono ging'we a batongeeji ba Bamidiani, a ba Olebu nū Zeebu. Mmho lūūlū ū nene nīītile mhayo kī ū ntaale ūyo gūshikile kūlenganījiwa nī yīyo ng'wīyītile a bing'we?” Aho wahaya ī yenīyo wiika ū būpelanu wabo, ūbo waalī wabenheleja bankolwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mizengo īyo īkalema kūngunanha Gidioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni na a banhū bakwe abo magana adatū baalī baanoga no, alīyo baalī bataalī dūhū būbakūūbīja a banishi; būshika a ha mongo gwa Yolodani būgūkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū wei ūbawīla banhū ba Sukoti gīkī, “Binhagi shilīwa a banhū bane benaba, nguno bayembaga no; alīyo nataalī nūbakūūbīja batemi ba Bamidiani, a ba Zeba nū Zalimuna.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeejia ba Sukoti būng'wīla, “Tūbinhe migatī yaakī a bashilikale bako abo baaseedeekaga benaba, gītī ninga wamalaga kūbadima a ba Zeba nū Zalimuna?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūshosha ūhaya, “Ndūhū ū mhayo naaheene, gwike ū Seeba ūlū alabatūūle a ba Zeba nū Zalimuna mu nkono gwane, ī mibīlī ying'we īkūtandagūka no, nguno nakwītūlīla ming'hwa na magwaata ga mu masaka!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīnga a henaho ūja Penieli, ūūkalomba gīko nū kwene; alīyo nabo būnshokeja dūhū gīt'ūmo bakanshokegeja a bana Sukoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Penieli ūbawīla gīkī, “Ūlū nalashoke mhola nakwīholomola ī numba ying'we ya balang'hani yenīyī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba Zeba nū Zalimuna baalī mu Kalikooli, pye na a mabità gabo ga bashilikale abo baalī baasaagīīla mu banhū abo baalī baafuma kīya; banhū ba kūshika shihūmbī ikūmi na shitaano. Abo baalī baashila kūcha bene baalī banhū shihūmbī igana na makūmi abīlī; bose benabo baalī bamanile kūlwa wa shū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūbītīla ng'wikūūwa lyalī lyasheshiwa na bashimizi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bashimizi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, banhū ba kūja bakūsaama saamaga; basamīīji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lyalī lībītile kū kīya na mizengo ya Noba na Jogibeha; abo wabapeejaga ūbisanganīja biyībaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a batemi ba Bamidiani a babīlī, a ba Zeba nū Zalimuna būpeela; gwike akabakūūbīja ūbapandīka ūbadima. Ī libità lyabo ī lyose lyūhaahūka lyūsambaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbūlagwa ba Zeba na Zalimuna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Gidioni ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi ūshoka ū kūfuma ū kū būlūgū, wiza na nzīla ya kūtulumenha kūbītīla Halesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wegeela ī Sukoti ūndima nsūmba nebe, ūmūūgīlīja a mina ga batongeeji ba ng'wene; ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo ūng'wandīkala mina makūmi mpungatī na mpungatī ga batongeeji ba mu Sukoti, abo baalī banamhala ba mu nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Gidioni aho washikīīla ī Sukoti ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “A ba Zeba nū Zalimuna baaba aha, abo ng'walūnidalahaga lūshikū lweene mukūhahayaga, ‘Tūbinhe migatī ya kī a bashilikale bako abo baaseedeekaga benaba, gītī ninga wamalaga kūbadima a ba Zeba nū Zalimuna?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbasola a banamhala ba mu nzengo, ūbinha nsango gwa kūtūlīlwa ming'hwa na magwaata ga mu masaka, kūlwa kūbalanga a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja nī Penieli ūūkīholomola ī numba yabo ya balang'hani; hama a bagosha ba mu nzengo gwenūyo ūbabūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbabūūja a ba Zeba nū Zalimuna gīkī, “A bagosha abo mukababūlaga Tabooli baalī ba mbika kī?” Būnshokeja, “Baalī gīt'ūmo ūlī ū bebe gīko, baali gītī baana ba batemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūshosha, “Agaya a benabo baalī baana ba ng'wise gete, baana ba ng'wa mayū; nalīng'wilahīlīla kūlī Seeba mpanga gīkī, ūlū ni mutababūlagile ni naaleka ū kūmubūlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūngalūkīla ng'witūnja wakwe; tangī wakwe, lina lyakwe Jeeta, ūng'wīla, “Bebe alibūūkaga ū babūlage a benaba!” Ū Jeeta ogoha ū kūlīsopoola ī līlūshū, nguno walī ataalī sūmba ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba Zeba nū Zalimuna būng'wīla, “Būūkaga ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūtūbūlage, nguno ūmo alī ū munhū nī nguzu jakwe h'ūmo jilī.” Ng'hana ū Gidioni ūbūūka ūbabūlaga, ūshīsola ī shikolo sha būlenji īsho shalī mu nhingo ja ngamīla jabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidioni kūbeeja shiikolile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli būng'wegeela ū Gidioni būng'wīla, “Ī gete tūsugage ū bebe, nguno watūpīgije kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa Bamidiani; nīyo nū ng'witūnja wako akūtūsuga, pyī nū ng'wizūkūlū wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūbawīla, “Ū nene natīīko ū kūmusuga, nū ng'witūnja wane atūdūla ū kūmusuga. Ū Seeba hū ng'wene ūyo akūmusuga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongeja kūbawīla, “Gwike nalīmulomba mhayo gūmò, gīkī būlī ūmò wing'we aninhe ī sīīlī ja kū matū, ījo ng'wapandīkile kwīnga kū bading'wa ba kūfuma mu būlūgū;” (nguno baalī Baishimaeli, banhū ba shīmīle sha kūzwaala sīīlī ja zahabu kū matū). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja būhaya, “Ī jenījo tūkūkwinha dūhū, nīyo na būyegi.” Na lūūlū bamba ng'wenda hasī, hūna būlī munhū ūyūponeja ho ī sīīlī ja kwīnga kū bading'wa ba mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būdito wa sīīlī ja zahabu ījo akalomba būshika gītī kilo ikūmi na kenda na nusu; kūleka kūshiisaaba ī shikolo sha būlenji ī shingī, nī migufu, nī myenda ya nzulunge īyo yazwalagwa na batemi ba Bamidiani; nūūlū ī migufu īyo yaalī mu nhingo ja ngamīla jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūjibeeja ī zahabu līshiikolile, ūlītūūla mu nzengo gwa ng'wawe gwa Ofla. Pye a Baisilaeli bandya kwisosohaja kūlwa kūlīlamya ī līshiikolile lyenīlo; lyūbiza lūtu ū kūlī Gidioni nū kū banhū ba mu kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bīsuga ī sī ya Midiani; na a ītabūūkje ntwe gwayo hangī ikanza lyose lyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Gidioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yelubaa ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi ūja kū ng'wawe, ūūkikala mu numba yaakwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na bitūnja bakwe gete makūmi mpungatī, nguno wal'atoolile mhalī ja bakīma bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Shekemu walīmo nkīma oshihyaga nang'hwe, nang'hwe akamyalīla ng'witūnja ūng'wilīka ī lina lya kwe Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Gidioni ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi ūcha mu būnamhala wa būlamu wawiza; ūjīkwa mu shigila sha ng'wihalo lya ng'wa ise Yoashi, mu nzengo gwa Ofla ya Baabiezeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni aho waacha, a Baisilaeli batadīīlile kwandya kwisosohaja kūlwa kūgalamya Maabaalī hangī. Būūtūūla ho lī Baali-beliti, gīkī hū lībize lī mulungu lyabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būng'wība gete ū Seeba ū Mulungu wabo ūyo wabapīja kūfuma kū banishi babo, abo baalī babapīndīlīgije mhandī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī kaya ya ng'wa Yelubaa (h'ū Gidioni), būlemeelwa ū kwīyītīla ya koolekeja būlūmbi ū mu yose īyo walī wabīītīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
